/research/recovery_20261025/runtime/preflight_d0_r2/*/render_only/rendered_prompt.txt
/research/recovery_20261025/runtime/preflight_d0_r2/*/render_only/request_body.bin
/research/recovery_20261025/runtime/preflight_d0_r2/*/render_only/response_body.bin
